WEBVTT

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:12.900
I'm going to stop this 
stupid fight between you!

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:15.630
Oh? It's being drawn out that long?

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:17.740
That's great. Just what I wanted.

00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:27.800
Student Council President! 
Let's talk about this!

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:29.760
Don't be absurd!

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:32.090
I have power!

00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:35.890
Power that you lack. 
Power to cleanse the world!

00:00:41.690 --> 00:00:43.260
Don't be deceived!

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:47.370
This has all been prearranged!

00:00:47.370 --> 00:00:49.070
It's a set-up!

00:00:49.070 --> 00:00:50.560
Big bro Gora?

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:52.040
What was set up?

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:55.380
All of it! This guy set up all of it!

00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:57.220
Let me go! Let me go, I say!

00:00:57.220 --> 00:00:59.750
Just who do you think I am?

00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:02.740
A talking goldfish? It couldn't be...

00:01:02.740 --> 00:01:06.280
Now, Hireashi! Confess everything!

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:08.550
I'll talk! I'll talk!

00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:11.340
I'll tell them everything. Just don't crush me!

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:13.490
Now, hurry!

00:01:13.490 --> 00:01:14.430
Yes, yes, yes!

00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:18.760
This is a reality show targeted
at the whole universe!

00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:22.100
The things you say, the things you do,
every move you make...

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:26.360
All of it, down to the tiniest detail, 
is being broadcast across the universe!

00:01:26.360 --> 00:01:28.230
Broadcast across the universe?!

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:32.660
They're watching you Earthlings divided 
into two groups and fighting each other!

00:01:33.060 --> 00:01:35.220
Wh-What did you say?!

00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:40.030
I never thought I'd have a moment in 
my life when I'd say "What did you say?!"

00:01:40.030 --> 00:01:41.630
But this is a real 
"What did you say?!" moment.

00:01:42.180 --> 00:01:44.620
Broadcast... across the universe?

00:01:44.930 --> 00:01:47.000
Chief Hireashi!

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:51.720
Big bro!

00:01:52.180 --> 00:01:53.990
Chief Hireashi! Are you all right?

00:01:53.990 --> 00:01:56.740
Of course I'm not all right! 
You took too long getting here!

00:01:56.740 --> 00:01:58.620
I am very sorry!

00:01:58.620 --> 00:02:00.940
Kinosaki-chan! Continue the broadcast!

00:02:01.210 --> 00:02:03.860
Okay! This is Kinosaki on the scene!

00:02:04.120 --> 00:02:09.700
Now let's have a talk with the leader 
of the Conquest Club, Kusatsu Kinshiro!

00:02:09.700 --> 00:02:12.370
How are you feeling right now?

00:02:12.970 --> 00:02:16.390
Say a few words to our viewers.

00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:20.420
Okay! That was Dark Aurite, 
A.K.A. Kusatsu Kinshiro,

00:02:20.420 --> 00:02:23.780
whose expression suggests 
some lingering shock!

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:25.650
That means...

00:02:26.230 --> 00:02:28.820
Everything I've said and done

00:02:28.820 --> 00:02:30.760
has all been watched?

00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:32.870
Yes, that's right!

00:02:32.870 --> 00:02:36.680
In addition to your battles, 
there have been hidden cameras set up

00:02:36.680 --> 00:02:39.140
in your student council room 
and personal spaces, as well!

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:42.640
It's all being broadcast 
throughout the whole galaxy!

00:02:43.170 --> 00:02:45.050
Throughout the whole galaxy?

00:02:45.300 --> 00:02:48.550
Yes! The faint yearning 
for your childhood friend,

00:02:48.550 --> 00:02:52.140
the obstinacy, the angry outbursts, 
the unavoidable failures of understanding...

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:53.990
You're a stand-out character!

00:02:54.350 --> 00:02:59.650
You're a conversation topic for thousands 
of millions of people across the universe!

00:03:00.210 --> 00:03:01.890
I-It can't be...

00:03:01.890 --> 00:03:03.910
It's the tsundere in you.

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:05.870
Big bro! Big bro!

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:08.370
Speak to me! Don't die!

00:03:08.650 --> 00:03:10.910
What are you doing, Caerula Adamas?

00:03:10.910 --> 00:03:13.290
Go and defeat the Battle Lovers!

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:16.050
What's the point in fighting them now?

00:03:16.370 --> 00:03:17.760
What was that?

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:21.540
Now that everything's been brought to light,

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:25.730
all my talk of order rings completely hollow.

00:03:25.730 --> 00:03:28.290
To whom do you think I gave

00:03:28.290 --> 00:03:30.650
the power to rule the world?

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:33.780
Tch.

00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:36.020
If it's come to this, go to plan B!

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:37.460
Do it, Zun-chan!

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:38.120
Sir!

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:40.880
Zundar Needles, activate!

00:03:44.550 --> 00:03:45.570
Big bro?

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:46.490
This is...

00:03:52.670 --> 00:03:54.250
G-Gora-san!

00:04:06.200 --> 00:04:08.130
B-Big bro Gora!

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:11.060
My name is Wood-Chopper Monster.

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:14.080
I will chop wood, and the world, in two!

00:04:15.010 --> 00:04:16.970
Wh-What did you say?!

00:04:16.970 --> 00:04:21.080
Okay, that's already the second
"What did you say?" of my life.

00:04:21.620 --> 00:04:23.610
He became a monster?

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:26.080
So it wasn't our power doing that?

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:32.960
Why... Why is my brother Gora...

00:04:35.060 --> 00:04:36.130
Chop!

00:04:40.520 --> 00:04:41.840
Stop it, big bro!

00:04:46.060 --> 00:04:47.710
He's so powerful...

00:04:47.710 --> 00:04:49.550
That's Yumoto's big brother for you.

00:04:49.550 --> 00:04:52.070
All that daily wood chopping
wasn't just for show.

00:04:52.070 --> 00:04:54.820
And what's with the hatchet?
That's a bit obsessive.

00:04:55.110 --> 00:04:57.770
Why are you so good at this, big bro?

00:04:58.020 --> 00:05:00.490
He actually noticed! Well done! Well done!

00:05:00.830 --> 00:05:02.490
Huh? What?

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:06.030
Now it's time for a nostalgic playback of old times!

00:05:06.550 --> 00:05:09.780
<b>TV Universe</b>

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:12.500
Universal Calendar 12015.

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:18.040
My employer, TV Universe, 
sent me, the skilled Hireashi,

00:05:15.310 --> 00:05:18.040
Reality Show

00:05:15.310 --> 00:05:18.040
<b>Can I Destroy 
the Earth?</b>

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:22.060
to be the director of a reality show: 
<i>Can I Destroy the Earth?</i>

00:05:25.680 --> 00:05:27.950
There was a despicable, wicked Earthling.

00:05:27.950 --> 00:05:30.930
His name was Hakone Gora.

00:05:31.870 --> 00:05:32.560
Chop!

00:05:33.230 --> 00:05:34.190
Chop!

00:05:34.850 --> 00:05:37.770
Chop!

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:47.530
That man vanquished all the monsters
we sent, one after another.

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:51.040
He had no consideration for how badly our viewers

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:53.890
wanted to see the Earth conquered and destroyed,

00:05:53.890 --> 00:05:57.510
and no ability to read the mood. 
He made all our plans come to nothing.

00:05:57.870 --> 00:06:02.460
Are you saying Yumoto's big brother was 
the previous generation of Battle Lovers?

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:03.970
Oh, now that you mention it...

00:06:04.560 --> 00:06:07.940
My brother would always sharpen 
his hatchet after I went to bed...

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:11.890
I saw him go out somewhere 
after that, lots of times.

00:06:12.440 --> 00:06:15.700
I was too scared to ask 
where he was going, though.

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:17.520
That would be pretty scary.

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:19.890
Yeah, on a pants-pissing level.

00:06:20.300 --> 00:06:24.150
Once the program lost its
concept, the ratings dwindled.

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:26.210
In the end, it was tragically canceled.

00:06:26.210 --> 00:06:30.450
CIDE is the only show I've ever 
directed that got canceled!

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:32.010
CIDE?

00:06:32.010 --> 00:06:34.460
I guess that's short for <i>Can I Destroy the Earth?</i>

00:06:34.460 --> 00:06:36.950
It's only natural that it was canceled!

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:40.200
I could not allow such 
foolishness and barbarism!

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:43.030
You received numerous complaints from 
the Space Ethics Improvement Organization,

00:06:43.030 --> 00:06:47.390
but you always make some vague 
excuse like "just watch it until the end"!

00:06:47.390 --> 00:06:50.550
Wait, you've known about all this from the start?

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:54.290
I'm just acting in the 
spirit of animal preservation!

00:06:54.290 --> 00:06:59.410
I couldn't stand watching the creatures of 
Earth wiped out for someone's entertainment!

00:06:59.410 --> 00:07:03.580
We're just giving the masses what they want to see!

00:07:03.580 --> 00:07:05.970
What kind of viral marketing is that?

00:07:05.970 --> 00:07:07.590
Your selfishness is your undoing!

00:07:07.590 --> 00:07:10.660
What about compliance, anyway?

00:07:10.660 --> 00:07:14.160
Compliance? Ha! I'm laughing so hard, 
I could brew tea in my navel!

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:16.570
I don't want to hear 
talk of navels from a fish!

00:07:16.570 --> 00:07:19.570
Silence! You have a pouch, and that's just gross!

00:07:19.570 --> 00:07:22.750
Are you going there? 
Are you really going to go there?

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:24.470
And what if I am?

00:07:24.470 --> 00:07:26.300
Then I'll go there, too!

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:29.100
The way you're always twitching your nose?

00:07:29.100 --> 00:07:30.930
That really bothers me!

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:33.430
I'm not twitching it!

00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:34.850
You are so!

00:07:35.090 --> 00:07:36.300
You really are.

00:07:36.300 --> 00:07:37.520
What?!

00:07:37.880 --> 00:07:39.810
Cut it out, you guys.

00:07:39.810 --> 00:07:42.940
I can't tell if it's cute or disgusting.

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:46.450
Anyway, since CIDE was a failure,

00:07:46.450 --> 00:07:49.280
I was exiled to the company 
history compilation office.

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:52.940
Even Aria-chan, the cabaret girl 
from Gotanda Planet, dumped me!

00:07:52.940 --> 00:07:54.710
It put me through the wringer!

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:58.700
You go to cabaret clubs? Also, those exist?

00:08:00.900 --> 00:08:03.810
Oh, really? The numbers are through the roof?

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:06.210
Okay, go at it! Make it look good!

00:08:06.510 --> 00:08:08.670
Chop!

00:08:12.900 --> 00:08:14.440
Why did Gora-san...

00:08:14.440 --> 00:08:16.080
He was standing there quietly all this time.

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:18.520
Why did he decide to start moving again now?

00:08:18.520 --> 00:08:20.300
That's the kabuki rule!

00:08:20.300 --> 00:08:23.110
When the camera's rolling, 
everyone else stops moving.

00:08:23.110 --> 00:08:26.020
Until the speaker's done with 
their lines, they must stand quietly.

00:08:26.020 --> 00:08:28.280
More precisely, they're incapable of moving!

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:29.690
Chop!

00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:32.240
Chop! Chop! Chop!

00:08:33.130 --> 00:08:34.510
Excellent!

00:08:34.510 --> 00:08:38.210
A former hero, fallen to the dark side. 
He becomes the ultimate enemy,

00:08:38.210 --> 00:08:41.170
and now stands in the way of his 
own flesh-and-blood little brother!

00:08:41.170 --> 00:08:44.100
Big bro, if you were really a hero once,

00:08:44.100 --> 00:08:46.340
how can you turn into a monster so easily?!

00:08:46.340 --> 00:08:48.680
Show some mettle, big bro!

00:08:56.710 --> 00:08:58.160
I refuse.

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:04.520
Stop it, big bro!

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:06.160
Chop!

00:09:08.430 --> 00:09:09.650
Stop it, I said!

00:09:09.650 --> 00:09:11.840
Oh, what a red-hot development!

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:14.860
Whoever wins, we're guaranteed rave reviews!

00:09:14.870 --> 00:09:18.040
I'm not really excited about 
attacking Yumoto's brother, but...

00:09:18.040 --> 00:09:20.460
This is no time for holding back!

00:09:21.010 --> 00:09:23.450
Vesta Ignit!

00:09:23.720 --> 00:09:25.740
Sulfur Gaia!

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:27.680
Epinard Hurricane!

00:09:27.680 --> 00:09:29.300
Cerulean Aqua!

00:09:29.300 --> 00:09:30.930
Chop!

00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:33.390
It's no use! We're no match for him!

00:09:33.390 --> 00:09:35.550
Big bro! Come to your senses!

00:09:35.940 --> 00:09:37.380
I refuse!

00:09:45.570 --> 00:09:47.100
Look at that power!

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:50.470
This is the Gora Power that
drove CIDE to cancellation!

00:09:50.470 --> 00:09:51.280
Excuse me.

00:09:51.910 --> 00:09:53.630
It's Kinosaki-kun, isn't it?

00:09:53.630 --> 00:09:55.520
Yes, that's right.

00:09:55.520 --> 00:09:58.800
Are you through interviewing 
our student council president?

00:09:58.800 --> 00:10:00.400
Yes, I'm done.

00:10:00.400 --> 00:10:03.130
What's going on here is far more interesting.

00:10:03.460 --> 00:10:04.780
Woah!

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:04.780
Got it.

00:10:04.780 --> 00:10:06.340
Then I have one more question for you.

00:10:06.340 --> 00:10:09.260
I'm busy right now. Can't it wait until later?

00:10:09.260 --> 00:10:11.300
No, it's a very simple question.

00:10:11.680 --> 00:10:13.200
Answer yes or no.

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:17.160
Did you know about their plan from the start?

00:10:17.160 --> 00:10:18.730
And that's why you've 
been doing your research?

00:10:19.010 --> 00:10:20.490
That's right.

00:10:21.080 --> 00:10:22.060
I see.

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:23.770
What is it?

00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:28.500
Akoya...

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:32.340
It's the duty of the youngest member 
to handle this kind of work, right?

00:10:41.190 --> 00:10:42.040
Yumoto!

00:10:42.470 --> 00:10:43.380
Chop!

00:10:44.530 --> 00:10:45.730
Chop!

00:10:49.360 --> 00:10:50.800
Chop!

00:10:58.770 --> 00:10:59.680
Kin-chan!

00:11:08.790 --> 00:11:09.810
What?

00:11:10.900 --> 00:11:13.160
Are you okay, Kin-chan?

00:11:15.180 --> 00:11:16.240
Why?

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:19.000
Because even though you 
might not feel the same way,

00:11:19.690 --> 00:11:23.200
I still think of you as a friend.

00:11:24.310 --> 00:11:25.410
At-chan...

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:41.260
"Cleanse" can also mean to 
make anew, to set things right.

00:11:42.110 --> 00:11:46.460
In that case, perhaps I need to cleanse myself.

00:11:47.020 --> 00:11:48.470
Chop!

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:50.990
Chop chop chop chop chop!

00:11:54.830 --> 00:11:55.820
Chop!

00:11:59.920 --> 00:12:01.170
Chop!

00:12:05.880 --> 00:12:06.840
Guys!

00:12:06.840 --> 00:12:09.070
Now! Use the Love Attack!

00:12:09.070 --> 00:12:09.780
Yeah!

00:12:10.030 --> 00:12:12.290
Sparkle, Lumiere of Love!

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:14.750
Flash, Purifying Aqua!

00:12:15.090 --> 00:12:17.250
Pierce, Gallant Hurricane!

00:12:17.700 --> 00:12:19.760
Roar, Raging Gaia!

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:22.310
Thrill, Blazing Ignit!

00:12:35.040 --> 00:12:38.560
Love Attack!

00:12:41.390 --> 00:12:43.160
Chop!

00:12:44.660 --> 00:12:45.810
The Love Attack...

00:12:45.810 --> 00:12:47.150
Chop!

00:12:47.150 --> 00:12:48.620
You won't chop us!

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:54.420
Chop!

00:12:54.420 --> 00:12:56.390
Big bro, snap out of it!

00:12:57.120 --> 00:12:58.880
Chop!

00:12:58.880 --> 00:13:01.290
This isn't my big brother!

00:13:01.290 --> 00:13:03.260
Ch... Chop...

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:07.280
If you become a minion of evil, 
who will chop the wood for the bath?

00:13:07.730 --> 00:13:08.820
Bath?

00:13:09.310 --> 00:13:13.120
That's right! The Kurotama Bath 
is everything to you, isn't it?

00:13:13.120 --> 00:13:15.250
Kurotama Bath...

00:13:15.250 --> 00:13:18.130
Remember the warmth of the bath!

00:13:18.780 --> 00:13:20.090
Warmth...?

00:13:37.840 --> 00:13:38.760
Yumoto grew...

00:13:38.760 --> 00:13:39.810
...wings?

00:13:39.810 --> 00:13:40.730
He's an angel?

00:13:40.730 --> 00:13:41.730
No way.

00:13:42.520 --> 00:13:44.910
That's the More Better Love Making!

00:13:44.910 --> 00:13:46.810
More Better Love Making?!

00:13:46.810 --> 00:13:48.160
That's right!

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:49.990
He's more better in every respect!

00:13:49.990 --> 00:13:52.770
In other words, he's the More Sparkling Prince!

00:13:53.260 --> 00:13:58.150
More Better Love Shower!

00:14:02.010 --> 00:14:04.610
What is this sensation?

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:06.970
It seems to warm me to my core...

00:14:07.460 --> 00:14:09.580
Comfort... Healing...

00:14:09.850 --> 00:14:12.540
Big bro, this is a bath.

00:14:12.970 --> 00:14:15.490
I see. This is a bath.

00:14:19.730 --> 00:14:22.140
Baths are great.

00:14:22.440 --> 00:14:24.020
Love is over!

00:14:24.020 --> 00:14:25.750
It's not over yet!

00:14:29.810 --> 00:14:32.360
Oh, fine! I'll say it as many times as you want!

00:14:32.360 --> 00:14:34.230
Wh-What did you say?!

00:14:35.760 --> 00:14:38.230
How dare you, how dare you, 
how dare you, how dare you?!

00:14:38.500 --> 00:14:42.200
You've rendered all my plans to nothing!

00:14:42.600 --> 00:14:43.520
That's...

00:14:44.080 --> 00:14:45.540
a porcupinefish?

00:14:45.540 --> 00:14:47.990
A goldfish and a hedgehog 
make a porcupinefish.

00:14:47.990 --> 00:14:49.730
It does make sense, logically...

00:14:49.730 --> 00:14:50.790
No it doesn't!

00:14:50.980 --> 00:14:53.060
Go! Finish them!

00:14:53.060 --> 00:14:54.710
Roger that!

00:14:55.780 --> 00:14:57.540
Transform!

00:15:04.430 --> 00:15:06.180
Porcupine...

00:15:06.180 --> 00:15:08.130
fish!

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:10.130
Wh-What did you say?!

00:15:21.490 --> 00:15:23.110
I don't think so!

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:31.760
Ultima...

00:15:31.760 --> 00:15:32.660
Adamas!

00:15:38.090 --> 00:15:41.340
Why would the student council... 
I mean, Caerula Adamas help us?

00:15:41.780 --> 00:15:45.010
As student council president,
I couldn't turn a blind eye

00:15:45.010 --> 00:15:48.090
to anyone causing harm to our students. That's all.

00:15:48.770 --> 00:15:50.810
Thanks, Kin-chan.

00:15:51.780 --> 00:15:54.730
Why?! Why are you like this, At-chan?

00:15:55.070 --> 00:15:58.890
You being so nice just lets me be selfish!

00:15:59.360 --> 00:16:00.690
It was the same then!

00:16:00.690 --> 00:16:03.810
You should have gotten angry and 
told me not to take things out on you!

00:16:03.810 --> 00:16:07.330
But because it was me, you didn't say anything.

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:08.710
You didn't do anything!

00:16:08.710 --> 00:16:11.460
That's why I could never apologize to you!

00:16:12.260 --> 00:16:13.370
Sorry.

00:16:13.910 --> 00:16:15.530
I don't want an apology!

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:17.570
Sorry.

00:16:20.360 --> 00:16:22.720
Kinugawa-senpai, at times like this,

00:16:22.720 --> 00:16:25.500
you should just say "I understand" 
and take them gently in your arms.

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:27.500
That's just how <i>you</i> do things.

00:16:27.810 --> 00:16:31.920
Does this mean we can walk 
home together and talk again?

00:16:33.730 --> 00:16:34.650
Yeah.

00:16:35.670 --> 00:16:39.190
Oh, this is the true love known as friendship!

00:16:39.190 --> 00:16:40.630
It's a happy end!

00:16:40.630 --> 00:16:43.440
I told you, it hasn't ended yet!

00:16:44.400 --> 00:16:48.570
I almost got stuck following the kabuki rule!

00:16:48.990 --> 00:16:50.520
You still want to fight?!

00:16:50.800 --> 00:16:53.450
In that case, everyone turn More Better!

00:16:54.960 --> 00:16:56.540
The More Flashing Prince!

00:16:58.100 --> 00:16:59.830
Battle Lover Cerulean!

00:17:00.320 --> 00:17:01.930
The More Piercing Prince!

00:17:02.970 --> 00:17:05.200
Battle Lover Epinard!

00:17:05.440 --> 00:17:07.120
The More Roaring Prince!

00:17:08.360 --> 00:17:10.590
Battle Lover Sulfur!

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:12.680
The More Thrilling Prince!

00:17:13.690 --> 00:17:15.460
Battle Lover Vesta!

00:17:15.790 --> 00:17:18.770
The Golden Chevalier, 
shining in greater radiance!

00:17:19.090 --> 00:17:20.320
Aurite!

00:17:21.160 --> 00:17:23.810
The Silver Chevalier, 
rustling even more young leaves!

00:17:23.810 --> 00:17:25.040
Argent!

00:17:25.760 --> 00:17:28.450
The Pearl Chevalier, 
making all the flowers bloom!

00:17:28.450 --> 00:17:29.620
Perlite!

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:32.800
We are the heirs to the throne of love!

00:17:32.800 --> 00:17:35.020
More Battle Lovers!

00:17:35.750 --> 00:17:37.650
"More Better"? Don't make me laugh!

00:17:37.650 --> 00:17:39.520
You're worse than before!

00:17:40.020 --> 00:17:41.710
It's true that it's a strange name...

00:17:41.710 --> 00:17:43.530
The name is just ornamental!

00:17:43.530 --> 00:17:45.670
Why can't they understand that?

00:17:45.670 --> 00:17:48.080
That's right! What really matters is love!

00:17:48.370 --> 00:17:49.330
Freedom!

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:50.550
Friendship!

00:17:50.550 --> 00:17:51.580
Money!

00:17:51.580 --> 00:17:52.840
Girls!

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:54.220
Beauty, right?

00:17:54.590 --> 00:17:55.670
I'm not sure.

00:17:55.950 --> 00:17:58.890
For Binan High School to 
remain Binan High School!

00:17:59.250 --> 00:18:00.390
Let's go!

00:18:01.040 --> 00:18:02.990
Let's turn the tables on them!

00:18:02.990 --> 00:18:04.360
Roger that!

00:18:18.720 --> 00:18:21.070
All of you together isn't enough!

00:18:21.970 --> 00:18:24.420
Yes, yes? S-Station director?

00:18:24.420 --> 00:18:26.620
Huh? What? Of course not.

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:30.330
The development may be a bit forced, 
but we got the proper go-ahead for it.

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:34.560
What? R-Right now? 
You can't cancel us that suddenly!

00:18:34.560 --> 00:18:37.370
Director! Um, D-Director?

00:18:37.370 --> 00:18:41.160
What about that night on Gotanda Planet?!

00:18:42.630 --> 00:18:46.160
Damn it! In that case,
I'll crush you all together!

00:18:46.160 --> 00:18:48.640
Fire! Fire! Keep firing!

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:52.540
But I'm afraid we've fired all our ammo, sir.

00:18:53.540 --> 00:18:54.730
Ergh!

00:18:55.810 --> 00:18:58.530
I'll tell you why you were canceled!

00:18:59.060 --> 00:19:00.170
What?

00:19:00.470 --> 00:19:03.810
Because you have no love
for your subject matter!

00:19:03.810 --> 00:19:08.160
Those who have no love 
cannot move the hearts of others!

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:11.330
More Better Love...

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:14.280
Attack!

00:19:23.540 --> 00:19:26.250
Love is... seriously... over!

00:19:30.720 --> 00:19:35.670
<i>And so, </i>Can I Destroy the 
Earth? Returns<i> was canceled.</i>

00:19:35.670 --> 00:19:40.930
I swear to only produce high 
quality programming from now on!

00:19:40.930 --> 00:19:42.200
Ditto.

00:19:54.090 --> 00:19:57.090
<i>The culture festival proceeded without incident,</i>

00:19:57.090 --> 00:20:00.260
<i>and their Cosplay Hero Curry sold out.</i>

00:19:57.090 --> 00:20:00.800
Sold Out

00:20:07.780 --> 00:20:10.600
Big bro, I'm getting in first, okay?

00:20:11.150 --> 00:20:14.150
Yes. Today's bath is in good condition.

00:20:14.620 --> 00:20:15.510
Yeah!

00:20:16.880 --> 00:20:18.020
Yo!

00:20:18.260 --> 00:20:20.040
Yo!

00:20:20.990 --> 00:20:22.040
Yumoto.

00:20:22.040 --> 00:20:26.250
Did you know that nikujaga and stew 
are brothers from different mothers?

00:20:27.960 --> 00:20:30.200
Naturally, stew is superior.

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:32.660
We're not talking about superior or inferior.

00:20:32.930 --> 00:20:35.880
But nikujaga's rather homely, isn't it?

00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:38.190
No, the broad-mindedness of nikujaga,

00:20:38.190 --> 00:20:41.500
that you can make it with beef 
or pork, is a thing to be admired.

00:20:41.780 --> 00:20:42.850
Either way,

00:20:42.850 --> 00:20:46.250
it's still sad when you get the wrong 
type of potatoes and they melt.

00:20:46.760 --> 00:20:50.960
Even if it gets mushy, I forgive them 
if they say "sorry" in a cute way.

00:20:52.300 --> 00:20:53.310
Huh?

00:20:53.310 --> 00:20:55.730
The point is, when you use 
the "mother" known as soy sauce

00:20:55.730 --> 00:20:58.390
instead of demi-glace sauce,
you give birth to nikujaga.

00:20:58.390 --> 00:20:59.440
Oh!

00:20:59.880 --> 00:21:01.640
Nikujaga, huh?

00:21:01.640 --> 00:21:04.360
I wish I could have fed some to Wom-san.

00:21:06.680 --> 00:21:08.040
That's true.

00:21:08.730 --> 00:21:12.830
Excuse me... Don't treat me 
like I'm dead just yet.

00:21:12.830 --> 00:21:14.530
Oh, sorry.

00:21:14.530 --> 00:21:17.670
But at this point in the story, you would
usually have gone back to your home planet.

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:21.650
I can't go back to space until 
Mr. Tawarayama is revived.

00:21:21.650 --> 00:21:24.720
Huh? What about your scientifically 
advanced medical mechanisms?

00:21:24.720 --> 00:21:26.960
That's likely just an excuse.

00:21:27.490 --> 00:21:28.020
Gulp...

00:21:28.020 --> 00:21:32.180
Well, that just means I can cuddle you more!

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:32.580
W-Wait! No, no, no.

00:21:32.180 --> 00:21:33.950
There, there, there.

00:21:32.580 --> 00:21:34.680
Well, I wouldn't say...

00:21:34.950 --> 00:21:36.160
Cuddle, cuddle.

00:21:36.160 --> 00:21:40.530
...that!

00:23:30.860 --> 00:23:34.890
<b>Important news after the break</b>

00:23:34.890 --> 00:23:39.850
<b><Important News>
After this, Mr. Tawarayama was brought back to life thanks to the 
"life" brought to Earth by one of Wombat's people. Thank goodness.</b>
